# Daftar Advisory — routing map
# Netlify _redirects. Publish-directory root, beside index.html.
# Filename must be exactly "_redirects" — no extension, no suffix.
# Evaluated top to bottom; first match wins.

# --- Research briefs -------------------------------------------------------
# /articles and /insights were indexed but have never been served. /knowledge
# is now a real index route, so these land on it rather than a home anchor.
/articles            /knowledge             301
/insights            /knowledge             301
/briefs              /knowledge             301
/research            /knowledge             301
/blog                /knowledge             301

# --- Services --------------------------------------------------------------
# /services and /services/<slug> are real routes served by the Next app
# (A/01 ifrs-financial-statements, A/02 technical-accounting-review,
# A/03 audit-readiness, C/03 quality-of-earnings). No rule for /services: it
# would shadow the page. The scope builder still takes a preselected line via
# /scope?service=statements|audit|review|transaction.
/what-we-do          /services              301

# --- Ethics ----------------------------------------------------------------
/ethics              /#ethics-values        301
/values              /#ethics-values        301

# --- About -----------------------------------------------------------------
# /about is now a real route served by the Next app. No redirect: a rule here
# would shadow the page itself.

# --- Contact ---------------------------------------------------------------
# No standalone contact page — the scope builder at /scope is the genuine
# equivalent. Kept on-site rather than 404'd.
/contact             /scope                 301
/get-in-touch        /scope                 301

# --- FAQ -------------------------------------------------------------------
/faq                 /#daftar-faq           301
/questions           /#daftar-faq           301

# --- Booking ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Microsoft Bookings is being prepared under ahmad@daftaradvisory.com. Keep
# both shortcuts on-site until its public URL is ready. 302, not 301: replace
# the destinations and the header CTA together when that URL exists.
/book                /scope                302
/call                /scope                302

# --- Deliberately absent ---------------------------------------------------
# /articles/*, /insights/*
#                    — child paths redirect to a list, not a replacement.
#                      Hold until the Search Console 404 export lands, then
#                      map individually. (/services/* now resolves to the
#                      real service pages; unknown children 404.)
# www / http apex    — Netlify already 301s both to the apex at the
#                      primary-domain layer. Verified 4 Aug 2026.
# /* -> /index.html 200
#                    — no client-side router exists. A catch-all would serve
#                      the same page under every URL.
